{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1fa6434c30f9bdab206ead1d10e576999eab0e4ed0fdf76a8ffd0bbe773f21c2","ja":"チャレンジの始まり","zh":"挑战的开始","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"76c63febbc88e0b792136726dac0c0175939475372428f70ab8296f3ac74d2ba","ja":"はいほー！\nスタジオの皆さん、まつりなのです！","zh":"嗨嗬——！\n演播室的各位，是茉莉哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d19a71147ecf63f4d7adfe1b4470a8e7684b66ac1e40ab728e4d72be14456459","ja":"見てください！　姫はさっそく、\n貴音姫と出会うことができたのですよ！","zh":"请看！姬马上就和贵音姬相遇了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cde50e309e17923fd82d7ccea64f20bb01090f9e8c7aec7e919d7868ecddf31c","ja":"まさかこの広い街で、\nこれほどまでに早く合流することができるとは……。","zh":"没想到在这座如此广阔的城市里，竟然能这么快就汇合……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0cd83df9a378de46e69e9bca4120b232666aee1e76010421c55d9c1a32401c1b","ja":"私の居場所を予見したまつり姫の慧眼、\n真、感服いたしました。","zh":"对于预见了我容身之处的茉莉公主的慧眼，我着实佩服。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6558db3df2857bbf33e6868c500ae185fac1cfa930240f2805d189395a555211","ja":"妖精さんが教えてくれたのです。\n貴音姫ならきっと、ラーメン屋さんにいるよって。","zh":"小精灵告诉我的哦。\n说贵音公主一定在拉面店里。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5ddbe707585829a92c05fef9269aff2c4738ebf2bac40e4a3372401f80d45d78","ja":"なんと！　……では、その妖精の方にも\nよろしくお伝えください。","zh":"没想到！……那么，也请代我向那位妖精问好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b8a9155b7cc7c6b1d8fc042b375d91d5722bc613ff1026d761c61b923a89971c","ja":"はい！なのです！\nでもチャレンジは始まったばかりなのです。","zh":"是的！\n不过挑战才刚刚开始哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7c4a537742666cb0c84d00950ef27099e2194ba2cf5a1d6e6840b363029ccfe2","ja":"まだ、翼ちゃんと恵美ちゃんにも\n出会わないといけないのですよ。","zh":"还得和翼、惠美相遇才行。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b744ca6b57d0f8da82ba627974736972a098281cf6b762f364eca9a4219ad3f2","ja":"そうですね……。それでは、\nてれびをご覧の皆様、改めて、行って参ります。","zh":"是啊……那么，\n正在收看电视的各位，我要再次出发了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c1590a1aad2f4eb67a8cfa6f118ae420f11561dc6dd366545321cabc421a9388","ja":"生放送中に私達4人が無事、出会うことが\nできるか……。結果をお楽しみください。","zh":"我们4人能否在直播中顺利相遇……敬请期待结果。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_909.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ae61e3d67fe5b1d147fb309ab82f8b45ac8d1a6ad74adc59b087554f62cbee9a","ja":"応援、よろしくなのです！","zh":"请多多支持！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
